  "knownLimitations": [
    "The corpus is synthetic and tests deterministic lexical behavior, not legal accuracy or real-world enforcement prediction.",
    "The tool does not identify implied claims that use unlisted language, analyze images or surrounding context, or understand negation, quotation, product category, audience, channel, or evidence.",
    "The lexicon is English-only and U.S.-focused; state-law references are a generic attention zone, not fifty-state coverage.",
    "Triage levels prioritize human review and are not probabilities, violation findings, or regulator-assigned classifications.",
    "Product-specific FDA status, FTC substantiation, labeling rules, cannabis restrictions, and state requirements must be checked against current primary authority and complete facts."
  ],
  "retestTrigger": "Any lexicon, matching logic, category, triage level, regulator-zone label, output field, authority boundary, or public capability claim change; otherwise 2026-11-01."
